## Why This Is Asked

This question probes practical experience with SAP on AWS and governance services, introducing a new angle: license compliance using native AWS tooling.

## Key Concepts

- AWS License Manager
- SSM Run Command
- CloudWatch, S3, and SNS integration
- Entitlements drift detection

## Code Example

```javascript
// Example: minimal Lambda to fetch License Manager data (pseudo)
const AWS = require('aws-sdk');
const lm = new AWS.LicenseManager();
exports.handler = async () => {
  const conf = await lm.listLicenseConfigurations({ /* params */ }).promise();
  // fetch SAP license data from SAP host and compare to entitlements
  return conf;
};
```

